{
  "title": "Yeasty Velvety Moroccan Currant Tagine",
  "description": "A light and flavorful Moroccan dish featuring currants and a yeasty velvety texture, cooked to perfection in a traditional clay tajine vessel over a tandoor",
  "cuisine": "Moroccan",
