      "name": "black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "water",
      "amount": "2 cups"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the tandoor to 400 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "In a small bowl, mix the yeast with 1 cup of warm water and let it sit for 10 minutes",
    "In the clay tajine vessel, heat the olive oil over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the ground cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the currants, yeast mixture, and water to the vessel and stir well",
    "Cover the vessel with a lid and cook for 30 minutes",
    "Remove the lid and cook for an additional 10 minutes",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired"
  ],
